        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="flashing-install-checks" value="Both options NOT ORDERED. Select compatible fixings&lt;br&gt;and sealant; do not assume a kit is included or use FX902&lt;br&gt;as a Master Flash specification. Check roof fit, bare-steel&lt;br&gt;protection and sealant service/cure temperatures." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#243447;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;">
