        <mxCell id="flashing-sourcing-status" link="https://www.ofen.de/lieferung-versand" value="&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ofen.de/lieferung-versand&quot; style=&quot;color: #1971c2;&quot;&gt;ofen.de: published Finland shipping terms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;EU dispatch to mainland Finland avoids import clearance;&lt;br&gt;normal checkout VAT still applies. Checked 2026-10-19.&lt;br&gt;Master Flash is an alternative brand, not Dektite." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#687787;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;">
